# Survey Corpus

This folder contains the structured survey corpus used in our paper.

## Files
- `survey_papers_160.csv` — main CSV dataset
- `survey_papers_160.xlsx` — spreadsheet version
- `survey_corpus_builder_160.py` — script used to build the dataset

## Notes
- `ref_no` matches the citation numbering in the paper.
- The dataset includes metadata such as year, venue, paradigm, stage, paper role, privacy notion, modality, and threat model.
